# The datasets are committed to this repository on purpose, so that a clone
# carries the data with it. See README.md.
#
# One exception: a file larger than GitLab's per-file limit cannot be committed
# as itself. Its committed form is the chunk set under data/dist/, and the
# reassembled original below is a build product - rebuild it with
# scripts/rebuild.sh or scripts/rebuild.ps1.
#
# Add one line per oversized dataset. `anac_data package` prints the exact line
# to add if it packages a file that is not covered here.
data/raw/anac/estatisticos/

# In-progress downloads and atomic-write temporaries
*.part
*.tmp
*.rebuilding

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/

# Local editor and agent tooling
.claude/
